# Agent tooling writes state into this repository. Ignoring it keeps `git status`
# honest and stops a stray `git add -A` from sweeping it into a commit.
# `hextap dev validate` consults these rules too, so ignored state mutating
# mid-run cannot produce a false `working tree changed during validation`.

# oh-my-claudecode operational state. `.omc/skills/**` is the intentional
# committable exception for project-scoped skills, so the direct children of
# `.omc/` are ignored individually rather than the directory as a whole — Git
# cannot re-include a path underneath an excluded directory.
/.omc/*
!/.omc/skills/

# Serena project memories and language-server cache.
/.serena/

# macOS Finder metadata, which Finder can drop into any directory at any time.
.DS_Store
